rgin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Conscious Parallelism (Tacit Collusion):&amp;nbsp;Without ever meeting, exchanging assurances, or signing an agreement, oligopolists can independently coordinate their behavior&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;prisoner&#39;s dilemma - and how it&#39;s always better to cheat on a cartel&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
